cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, the frozen benchmark, or the reproducibility bundle,
  please cite both this record and the paper that generated the underlying data
  (Schaff et al. 2026, listed under references).
title: >-
  CellFate-Rx Generation 1: clone-level prospective evaluation of
  condition-specific state information in a lineage-traced melanoma line
abstract: >-
  A preregistered reanalysis of the six-condition clonal-tracing dataset
  GSE279162. Tests whether pretreatment transcriptional state carries
  condition-specific information about future clonal detection, beyond
  condition identity and captured pretreatment clone abundance, under
  clone-held-out evaluation, with the ranking test frozen by digest before any
  ranking statistic was computed. Ships the frozen predictor, the full stage
  record including failed and negative results, and three verification tools
  that refuse on any modified artifact. No new data were generated.

